&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will oversee a strategic portfolio in Retail/Travel, guiding local business developers to expand our footprint and network. Additionally, you will directly manage major accounts across the entire lifecycle, from lead generation, proposal, and contract negotiation to delivery governance, relationship management, and long-term account growth.&lt;/p&gt;
