&lt;li&gt;Ability to connect business needs with technology solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with ambiguity and complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem Solving&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Breaks down complex challenges into logical components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesizes information into clear recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinks strategically while remaining detail-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates executive-ready presentations and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to explain technical concepts to business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Enabled Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI tools to enhance research, analysis, and content creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands how to validate AI-generated outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously explores new ways to improve productivity through AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
