&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid experience in one or more of the following: Management or technology consulting, Business analysis, Technology strategy, Product or digital transformation or Data, research, or analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your experience working on technology-enabled business initiatives is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in Business &amp;amp; Technology Analysis and have strong analytical and critical thinking skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to connect business needs with technology solutions and you are comfortable working with ambiguity and complex problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a structured problem solver, breaking down complex challenges into logical components, synthesizing information into clear recommendations and thinking strategically while remaining detail-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
