&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an excellent communicator written and verbal, you create executive-ready presentations and documentation, and you are able to explain technical concepts to business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are AI-enabled and comfortable using AI tools to enhance research, analysis, and content creation. You understand how to validate AI-generated outputs and continuously explore new ways to improve productivity through AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work collaboratively and effectively across multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You partner closely with Technology Advisors, architects, designers, engineers, and client stakeholders and Builds trusted relationships with clients and colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
