&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;You can contribute to the design and implementation of enterprise and/or web-scale hosting platforms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;using Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and can administer application servers, web servers, and databases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working with software delivery teams, and understand DevOps philosophies, Agile methods, &lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code&lt;/strong&gt; and how to apply them to your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve previously worked with monitoring and &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;45&quot;&gt;observability&lt;/strong&gt; systems, including &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;78&quot;&gt;Grafana&lt;/strong&gt;, for availability, performance or security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a solid understanding of telemetry attributes and &lt;strong&gt;observability semantic conventions&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure structured data and effective monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a deep understanding of cloud and virtualization platforms, infrastructure automation and application hosting technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a history of working with at least one IaaS cloud platform, and two or more application runtime platforms including physical servers, virtual servers, container clusters, serverless and databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can write scripts using at least one scripting language and are comfortable building one or more of: Linux servers, Windows servers, or container clusters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with continuous integration and continuous delivery tools with different tech stacks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an understanding of security concerns, threats and approaches for dealing with them, including infrastructure platform vulnerabilities, secrets management, network security and software supply chain security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus points if you have experience with unit testing and automated testing tools, stress and performance testing.&lt;/li&gt;
