&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architecture Expertise: Experience across solution, enterprise, cloud, data, and integration architecture in complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Pre-sales: Hands-on involvement in pursuits, discovery, solution shaping, proposals, workshops, and RFP responses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern Engineering Knowledge: Strong understanding of software delivery practices, architecture patterns, and trade-offs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution Design: Ability to create scalable, practical, and business-aligned technology solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regional Tech Awareness: Familiarity with Thailand/SEA technology landscape and ecosystem.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Value Focus: Ability to translate technical capabilities into tangible client outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
