&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Influence: Ability to engage and influence senior executives and engineering teams effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Commercial Acumen: Understanding of profitability, growth levers, and deal shaping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting Capability: Strength in facilitation, problem structuring, and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial Mindset: Comfortable working in ambiguity and building new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Mentoring: Experience guiding senior technologists and building strong teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication Skills: Clear and effective communication across local and global stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language Skills: Proficiency in Thai is highly preferred, English for global collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
