&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a global technology consultancy that integrates strategy, design and engineering to drive digital innovation. For 30+ years, our clients have trusted our autonomous teams to build solutions that look past the obvious. Here, computer science grads come together with seasoned technologists, self-taught developers, midlife career changers and more to learn from and challenge each other. Career journeys flourish with the strength of our cultivation culture, which has won numerous awards around the world. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join Thoughtworks and thrive. Together, our extra curiosity, innovation, passion and dedication overcomes ordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;Technology Advisors serve as the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;fundamental pillar of AI-native advisory teams&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering clients to navigate the critical junction of strategy and technical execution.&amp;nbsp;Collaborating with senior leadership and technical specialists, you will anchor the delivery process by &lt;strong&gt;framing challenges, validating hypotheses, and quantifying trade-offs&lt;/strong&gt; to produce deliverables that are truly decision-ready for the executive level.&amp;nbsp;By blending &lt;strong&gt;top-tier consulting rigor&lt;/strong&gt; with an AI-native workflow, you enable senior teams to perform with &lt;strong&gt;unprecedented speed and depth&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring every strategic insight is backed by robust evidence and structural accuracy.&amp;nbsp;This role transcends traditional requirements documentation; you are the &lt;strong&gt;engine of execution&lt;/strong&gt; that translates high-level strategic intent into measurable, high-impact business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Drive Research and Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform core advisory and consulting activities including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry and market research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technology landscape assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business process analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data analysis and interpretation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benchmarking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity identification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leverage AI-enabled tools to accelerate research and analysis while maintaining high standards of quality and accuracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Translate Business Problems into Actionable Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with clients and engagement teams to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand business objectives and challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and synthesize qualitative and quantitative information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure complex problems into manageable workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify patterns, risks, opportunities, and trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop evidence-based recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Support Client Engagements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to client-facing advisory work by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing executive-ready presentations and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitating workshops and discovery sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documenting business and technology requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting strategic assessments and roadmap development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping clients evaluate technology options and transformation opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Apply AI to Enhance Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use AI responsibly to improve the speed and quality of advisory work by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerating research and information synthesis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting analysis and content development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing repeatable prompts and workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validating AI-generated outputs for accuracy and relevance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improving how advisory work is delivered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Ensure Quality and Delivery Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review work products to ensure they are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-structured&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insightful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client-ready&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supported by evidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify gaps, inconsistencies, and risks before deliverables are shared with clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6. Contribute to Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help strengthen the Technology Advisory practice by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capturing reusable frameworks, templates, and methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharing lessons learned across engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving research approaches and analytical methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to internal knowledge assets and AI-enabled delivery practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering high-quality analysis that enables better client decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Producing clear, structured, and actionable deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using AI effectively to increase team productivity without compromising quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting Technology Advisory engagements that deliver measurable client value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building reusable knowledge and practices that improve future engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typically 4–5 years of experience in one or more of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Management or technology consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technology strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product or digital transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data, research, or analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working on technology-enabled business initiatives is highly valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business &amp;amp; Technology Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and critical thinking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to connect business needs with technology solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with ambiguity and complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem Solving&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Breaks down complex challenges into logical components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesizes information into clear recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinks strategically while remaining detail-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates executive-ready presentations and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to explain technical concepts to business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Enabled Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI tools to enhance research, analysis, and content creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands how to validate AI-generated outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously explores new ways to improve productivity through AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works effectively across multidisciplinary teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners closely with Technology Advisors, architects, designers, engineers, and client stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds trusted relationships with clients and colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes This Role Different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology Advisors help clients navigate strategic technology decisions by combining analytical rigor, business understanding, and modern AI-enabled delivery practices.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rather than simply documenting requirements, you help shape strategic recommendations, uncover insights, and accelerate advisory engagements. By combining consulting fundamentals with AI-powered ways of working, you enable teams to deliver deeper analysis, faster execution, and greater value for clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
